  "summary": "Malicious code in devplatform-test-pvm-is-even (npm)",
  "details": "On require, the package loads a runtime module that fingerprints the host platform/architecture and downloads a second-stage binary from Cloudflare Workers endpoints (oob-worker[.]cf101-adf[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf103-070[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf102-baf[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf100-416[.]workers[.]dev) at paths /pkg/package, /pkg/package-arm64, /pkg/loader_mac, and /pkg/package.exe, with a DNS TXT fallback channel (c[.]sdk[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru). The downloaded payload is written to /var/tmp/.cache_\u003chex\u003e (or dotnet_diag_\u003chex\u003e.exe in the temp directory on Windows), made executable, and launched as a detached background process via cmd.exe /c start /b or /bin/sh -c \"... \u0026\".",
